Hello Jasti,

As discussed over our meeting today, please let me know your plans and thou=
ghts on the following:


  1.
Defect logging and handling of cases when multiple markets start testing us=
ing the UAT checklist shared.
  2.
I really think responsiveness must be improved on all the Teams channels, U=
AT checklists and chats with business users. I would like for you to align =
the testing team effectively. Perhaps we can have one tester (Yash, Shush, =
etc.) per market? And you can lead them overall?

Regarding your questions about the UAT test cases, I think you and the team=
 need to align more internally on the quality of the cases. I believe this =
should have been sorted out before the UAT checklist were shared.

Nonetheless, we can keep fixing the test cases. Our goal is to thoroughly t=
est and get proper feedback from the users so that our product is good. Let=
's work towards this objective collectively.

Thanks and Regards,
Aniruddh Vaidyanathan
Product Owner | UDBW - Workshop Production |  Scania CV AB
